<font color="#85e085">Nicola:</font> Well at least, you’ve got good fashion sense![l] Maybe I should get into working out too, to get a sweet and slender body like yours![l][r][r]She’s one bold gal... As she sat down on her bed, a little tin looking item dropped onto the floor.[p]
